* In [[HZ138]], the mother and father of the [[Fake Rising Volt Tacklers]] Mega Evolved their {{p|Raichu}} into Mega Raichu X and Mega Raichu Y, respectively, during a battle against the real [[Rising Volt Tacklers]].
* In [[HZ142]], [[Ivor]] Mega Evolved his {{p|Falinks}} during a battle against Roy's Lucario.

